  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/P1012455.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este viernes se ha iniciado la V Ruta Love Tonic de Hosturionda, que se extender&aacute; hasta el domingo 29 de abril y en la que participan nueve locales, entre ellos New Robinson, Man&aacute; Bar, Gran Hotel Toledo, Chaplin Caf&eacute;, Donde Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; y Druida Bar&amp;Drinks. Ginebras y tonicas premium, en diferentes combinaciones, por s&oacute;lo 5 euros. Adem&aacute;s se reparten 300 euros en premios.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012433.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012435.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012436.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012437.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012438.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012439.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutalovetonichosturionda18primerdia/p1012440.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91